# The sync image's build context is the repo root (docker/sync/Dockerfile, brief 100 task 15). An
# allow-list: only what that Dockerfile copies is sent. `.env`, `course context/`, `local_cache/`,
# any secrets folder, and every node_modules, dist, .venv and __pycache__ stay out, so nothing
# secret or host-built (a Windows venv breaks `uv run` on Linux) reaches a layer.
*
!docker/sync/
!sync/
!ingest/
!desktop/src/core/sync-id.ts
sync/node_modules
sync/dist
sync/coverage
ingest/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.env
**/.env.*
course context
local_cache
secrets
